/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The Automatic Alcohol Sprayer is designed to address the need for improved hygiene and reduced cross-contamination in public and shared spaces such as classrooms, offices, and entrances. Traditional manual alcohol dispensers require physical contact, which can contribute to the spread of bacteria and viruses, especially in high-traffic environments. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
