/P 91 0 R
/E (The project involves designing and developing a prototype Automatic Alcohol Sprayer using an Arduino microcontroller, ultrasonic sensor for hand detection, and mini pump for automatic alcohol dispensing. It focuses on basic touchless detection and automated dispensing in a small-scale setup for demonstration purposes, incorporating hardware integration and simple embedded programming. Advanced features like IoT connectivity, mobile app integration, battery optimization, liquid level monitoring, and commercial-grade casing are excluded.)
